> How much should I utilize kicking early as a
> weapon with a martial arts enabled character?

Damage-wise kicking is inferior to striking, even with MA (there it's 
d4+skill bonus(3/5/7/8/9)+strength bonus (+1 at str. 16, going up to +6 
at str. 18/** )). OTOH kicking doesn't take a to-hit roll but has a flat 
1/4-1/3 (depending on your dex) chance to miss. Also it ignores damage 
reduction from negative AC. So it might be an option on the very early 
game, when your luck is down, or to take out any low AC, low HP creature.

